WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.920
Toriko's 100th Episode Special!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.760
This makes the 100th episode 
of the animated <i>Toriko</i>!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.590
Then next time, it'll be episode 101, right?

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:00.160
That's awesome, Komatsu! And 
the one after that will be 102!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.700
Uh, of course!

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:04.970
So, to mark this 100th episode,

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:09.970
we'll announce the results of the <i>Toriko \</i>NPopular Character General Election.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.710
Don't miss it!

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.980
Toriko-san, you can't look 
at the results beforehand!

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:21.480
I wasn't lookin'! I was just, 
uh, pretendin' to look!

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:22.980
Really?

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:24.850
Yeah, really!

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.850
I wouldn't do that kinda thing!

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:28.390
Are you really sure about that?

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.360
Yeah, I'm really, really sure!

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.360
Look at this serious face!

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:38.000
I'm sorry I was suspicious of you, partner.

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:41.400
Alright, stay tuned to the 
very end of the show...

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.510
I said I'm not lookin'!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:50.880
Look! Look! Look, right?!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.880
Someone once said...

00:02:55.210 --> 00:03:01.820
There are exquisite ingredients with 
flavors that are out of this world.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.620
Only people who have mastered certain skills

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:09.330
can capture and cook these 
elusive ingredients.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:13.200
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:18.840
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.650
It's totally frozen over!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.420
That's amazing!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.230
And Yun's having a great time!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.040
The pond icing up works to our advantage...

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.910
...when it comes to capturing the Madam Fish.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:01.880
Coco!

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.810
Coco-san!

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:03.810
It's Coco!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.580
Still, I can't understand it...

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:08.520
Why did the stew suddenly freeze?

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.750
Sunny-san!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.750
Sunny!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:10.720
Bro!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.390
Who cares about that crap?!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.330
A Sound Bullet! Zebra!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.530
Zebra-san!

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:21.760
I haven't heard that creepy 
voice in quite a long time.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.640
It seems you've become a bit decent, 
even following the president's orders.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.400
Dumbass!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.840
"Dumbass", you say?!

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:33.380
I only came 'cause I wanna eat that fish!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.110
So, Sunny... Nah, make that all youse guys...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:43.050
What do you say we make a game of it, 
see who catches that Madam Fish first?

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.820
A fishing challenge!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.690
You forget who you're talking to!

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:52.930
You've got some guts, challenging 
my sensors to a fishing competition!

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:53.600
They've started already...

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.360
What do you say, Toriko?

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.770
Let's have a match.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.070
Great idea. I'm in!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.600
A competition between the 
Four Kings Gourmet Hunters?!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:12.050
The Four Kings Assemble 
to Mark the 100th Episode!

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:19.420
Since everyone's here, I think it'd 
be better if we all cooperated

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.890
and fished together...

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.990
What are you talkin' about, Komatsu?!

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:28.560
If this competition was gambling, 
everybody'd be bettin' on your Gourmet Luck!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.970
Y-You mean I'm going to participate 
in the competition, too?!

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.170
I'm catchin' a delicious-smellin' 
aroma comin' off of the pond!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.470
With the Seaweed Snakes and Kelp 
Snakes growin' at the bottom,

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:43.510
it turns the whole pond 
into natural soup stock!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.580
Stew Pond lives up to its name.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:48.110
It really is like first-rate stew!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.550
And I'm thinkin' the Madam 
Fish that lives in this pond

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.450
would make a good filling 
for the Fortune Roll!

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.020
Fortune Roll?

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:58.090
Monchy-san, a Gourmet Fortune 
Teller, is going to make it for us.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:00.130
When that thing points in a direction,

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:04.060
it indicates the location of the ingredient 
you're lookin' for with 100% accuracy!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:07.230
Points in a direction... to the 
ingredient you're looking for...?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:09.200
The sixth training ingredient

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.140
on Old Man Ichiryu's list...

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:14.010
So first we have to gather the 
ingredients for the Fortune Roll...

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:15.770
In that case, I'll fish with Toriko!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.840
I'll do my best for you, Toriko!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.080
Yeah, yeah, I know...

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.050
Then I'll...

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:27.850
...fish together with Yun.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:31.390
The pond is teeming with delicious fish,

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.360
raised in this thick, 
nutrient-rich soup stock.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:38.160
But of them all, Madam Fish is 
called the Mistress of the Pond.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.300
Her luminescence is such a feast for the eyes

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.600
and her fat gives her such a rich taste

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:45.970
that she draws high acclaim as the 
grande dame of freshwater fish.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:51.440
This beautiful ingredient is perfect for me.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.680
Madam Fish's Capture Level is 83,

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.320
but that's not a reflection 
of its fighting strength.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.750
Rather, it's because fishermen 
never get to see the fish,

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.820
as like a fair lady, it rarely 
ventures outside of its nest.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:11.360
I've heard that it sometimes 
stays holed up for decades...

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.560
The only chance...

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:17.200
...is when Madam Fish feels safe, with 
the surface of the pond frozen over.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.100
That time is now!

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.840
The freezing Ice Hell <i>is \</i>Nyour hometown, right, Yun?

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:31.510
This land of ice must make you 
happy and bring back memories, huh?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.080
But at any rate,

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:36.620
the surface is 300 square kilometers...

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:42.120
Looks like it's going to be tough 
finding the right spot to fish...

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.260
This ain't nothin' but a 
little-bitty puddle to me!

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.800
Zebra-san!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:53.100
Your cookin' skills haven't 
gotten rusty, have they, kid?

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.970
Nope! I polish my skills everyday 
so I can make delicious food!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.040
How's it going for you, Zebra-san?

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.540
Have you decided on your life's Full Course?

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:08.220
Get ready. You won't be 
able to stop droolin'!

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:14.360
Zebra's Full Course Menu

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:14.360
Hors d'oeuvre: Fierce God Guts 
(Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 91

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:12.120
The hors d'oeuvre is Fierce God Guts.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:14.360
Soup: Equator Soup Capture Level 87

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.320
The soup is Equator Soup.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:24.000
Fish Dish: ???

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:24.000
Meat Dish: BBQ Island Capture Level Unknown

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:24.000
Main Dish: ???

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:24.000
Salad: ???

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:24.000
Dessert: Offering to the 
Daruma Capture Level Unknown

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:24.000
Drink: Mellow Cola (Drinking 
Water) Capture Level 92

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.390
The meat dish is BBQ Island.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.260
The dessert is Offering to the Daruma.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:25.570
The drink is Mellow Cola!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.570
I got three left...

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:32.970
How 'bout that?! You feel like 
partnerin' up with me now?!

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.280
I...

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.510
I'm partners with Toriko-san, so...

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:45.250
Until my Full Course is complete, that is...

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.720
Well, look forward to it, kid...

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.930
Right! I can't wait!

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:57.400
What's wrong? You suddenly 
stopped walking, Toriko...

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.800
Zebra's got sound...

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.240
Sunny has touch...

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.470
Coco's got electromagnetic waves...

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.410
Komatsu has Gourmet Luck...

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.880
And you've got sense of smell, Toriko!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.010
No matter what we go up 
against, we lack nothin'.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.250
No way we're gonna lose, Rin!

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:17.180
Yep!

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:22.320
In fact, with these members after her, 
I've gotta feel sorry for Madam Fish!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.290
In this vastness,

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.760
the point where Madam Fish inhabits is...

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.340
...over there!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.370
Strong electromagnetic waves...

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.210
I'll try making an approach from here...

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.950
Heat Poison!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:58.890
Alright...

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.030
My chance of success from this point...

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.490
About 40%...

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.700
Hair Cutter!

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:21.710
There!

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:24.110
But no fish!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.920
The best thing to do is just 
grab it directly and haul it up!

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:46.300
The speed of sound in water is 
4 1/2 times what it is on land.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:48.940
I'm gonna find you in an instant...

00:10:55.750 --> 00:11:01.150
Echolocation! Voice Sonar!

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.260
Hey, Yun!

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:14.900
Would you take out the Tasty Worms?

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:21.300
Thanks! These Tasty Worms 
will make nice bait.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.640
He's playing too much...

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:29.710
Around here, huh?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.910
Alright!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.050
Knife!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.780
Fork!

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:47.160
Delicious! Even frozen, the soup 
stock flavor is alive and well!

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.730
Toriko!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.700
I got things ready!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.740
Thank you, Rin!

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.270
My nose is talkin' to me!

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:02.540
It says the Madam Fish is right below us!

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.610
Oh, Toriko...

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.550
We don't have to catch it right away...

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.380
I'd much rather have you catch me!

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.320
Why not?!

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:14.550
And then I want you to feed me...

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.690
What?!

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:19.560
For one thing, I wanna be with Toriko... 
For another, I wanna be with Toriko...

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:29.270
Some fish that give off ultrasonic 
waves are messin' up my sonar!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:33.040
Pain in the ass! I'll take 
care of alla youse at once!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:39.010
Voice Bazooka!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.470
Ow!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.070
What was that?!

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:11.980
Zebra?!

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:14.450
That... idiot!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:16.650
I...

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.850
...caught something...

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:24.690
Elephant Shrimp (Crustacean 
Beast) Capture Level 35

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.690
D-Disgusting!

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.720
What is that?! Disgusting!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.660
Disgusting! Disgusting! 
Disgusting! Disgusting!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.260
Okay. I got a nibble.

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.360
But is this...?

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:37.700
It's on to me...

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.870
This is quite difficult.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.970
That vibration was from Zebra, 
I'll bet. Good grief...

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:53.420
Butterfly Eel and Sake Salmon...

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.650
Both of them are high class fish.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.350
Like I thought, Tasty Worms 
sure brings them in, huh?

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.820
But our goal is Madam Fish.

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:04.260
Let's keep at it!

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.100
Look, Rin.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.500
When you make the bait wobble, 
it catches the fish's eye.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.970
I've got confidence in my luring technique.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.780
You've lured <i>me</i> in and I'm head over heels!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.250
There it is!

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.250
What is this?

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.790
Gross!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.060
I'm moving to a different spot! I'm moving!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:46.470
I estimate my chance of success 
will be 60% if I fish in this area.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.310
That's what they get for bein' cocky.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:15:01.720
Alright, the shape of the 
fish like the one I want...

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:05.150
...is more over there...

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.490
No good here either, huh?

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.830
Koala! Koala! Koala!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.740
These are disgusting, too!

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.350
It keeps movin' around...

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:36.820
But you ain't gettin' away from me!

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:41.620
I'll go to a spot where the electromagnetic 
waves are a little stronger...

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:48.430
Shall I show you the power of my intuition?

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.070
Let's move, Rin.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.500
To a point that smells even more savory!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:58.500
Sure!

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.780
There it is! Its nest is...

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.850
The place that has a 90% chance 
of successful capture is...

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.120
The point that my intuition 
has directed me to is...

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.760
The smell that's makin' me drool 
non-stop is comin' from...

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.260
...right here!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.270
How much Gourmet Luck do you have, Komatsu?!

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.510
W-What?!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:35.840
What's everyone doing here?!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.980
Our target's nest is right under us!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.310
Really?!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.250
That's what my intuition says,

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.420
so there's no mistake.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.690
Dumbass! It's my Echo that's proof positive!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.920
Don't belittle my intuition, 
Zebra, you big oaf!

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:55.090
There's a 90% chance we'll be able to 
catch it at this point, Komatsu-kun.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:55.960
Nope!

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:58.830
My schnozzle is sayin' the chances are 100%!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.100
Wait a second!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.400
The bobber... It's moving...

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:12.880
He's got 'er!

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.350
No doubt about it! That's the Madam Fish!

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:18.380
Unbelievable, but he got a 
hit from deep inside its den!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:21.480
Hey, Zebra! Don't just attack 
it! You'll spoil the flavor!

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:25.120
Do I really have the Madam Fish?!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.120
There's a 90% chance, Komatsu-kun!

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.260
Alright! I'll take over from here!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:31.490
No way, I'll do it!

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.160
I'm the expert fisherman here!

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:36.170
Back off! My sensors can 
get it with one shot!

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:37.130
Do you want me to do it?

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:39.700
Let's all do it together!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:58.290
Madam Fish (Fish Beast) Capture Level 83

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:55.850
We got it!

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:58.650
That's the Madam Fish?! It's huge!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:10.470
That's a Jackal Kite!

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.430
Also called a Madam-killer!

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:17.540
Apparently, it doesn't hunt itself, but 
goes after and feeds on other's prey!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.240
So it's gonna try an' eat our Madam Fish?!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.110
Super Relaxation!

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:26.210
I'm the one who's gonna eat!

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:28.320
Voice Missile!

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.790
Poison Rifle!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.630
Flying Fork!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.540
Hair Punch!

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.980
Yeah!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:08.950
Those who sit down at one table, eh?

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.530
They bicker like anything, but 
still eat together merrily.

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:17.400
Maybe we can pin our hopes on them.

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:21.970
Those four were able to 
capture the Madam Fish.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.840
Just as I expected. Still...

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:28.640
Being able to freeze Stew 
Pond in an instant...

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.810
You've got a bright apprentice, Setsunon.

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:34.980
This is Nono, my one and only staff member.

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:41.490
I've got to tell Jiro-chan, too,

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:45.460
that Ichi-chan and Midora 
didn't reach an accord.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:54.170
It's thanks to my Voice Missile, 
right?! So I'm gonna eat it!

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.300
Don't be stupid!　My Hair 
Punch was the deciding factor!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.940
I did stop it from moving with my poison...

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:03.610
Komatsu found this spot in the first place...

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:06.640
Nah, it's thanks to everyone.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:10.550
If it had been attacked by the 
Jackal Kite, it'd be all over.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.080
Well, anyway, let's eat!

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:16.350
W-Wait a second, Toriko-san!

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:18.420
Aren't we supposed to use it 
for the Fortune Roll filling?

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:20.920
Yeah, we'll save a little for that...

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.890
A <i>little</i>?! Toriko-san!

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:29.770
Under our feet, over our heads

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:38.040
The world is spinning

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:43.210
A dream flower

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:46.880
Is blooming, blooming

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:53.990
Tell me the rest, come on

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:57.630
Lead me by the hand

00:20:57.630 --> 00:21:00.960
And take me with you

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:08.600
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:12.470
Red shoes

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:15.710
I can't take off

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:26.620
I'm the only one dancing

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:35.730
Toriko's 100th Episode Special
<i>Toriko</i> Popular Character General Election

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:32.660
Thank you for your patience! To 
mark this special 100th episode,

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:35.630
I'm going to announce the results of 
the Popular Character General Election!

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:39.700
There were 13,937 votes cast

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:42.400
with 71 possible characters to choose from.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.710
As you can see, here are the results 
for 4th through 10th place!

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:47.110
Starjun
Teppei
Melk II

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:50.010
Sunny
Yun
Starjun

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:52.210
Terry
Komatsu

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:54.480
Yun and I are on there!

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.380
Thank you very much, everyone!

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.220
Terry's really popular, too!

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:01.720
Okay, in 3rd place we have...

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:05.260
Zebra, who got 1,108 points!

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:07.390
That guy's surprisingly popular!

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:10.000
That's because he's actually a kind person...

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.170
Everyone really understands that.

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:14.300
Let's go on to 2nd place!

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:19.710
Coco, who received 1,464 points!

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:21.740
Damn, Coco!

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:25.140
Coco-san has a lot of female fans.

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:25.810
And finally...

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:28.680
...in prestigious first place...

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:39.260
...Toriko, who received 1,539 points!

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:42.290
Congratulations, Toriko-san!

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:43.260
Huh?

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:51.700
Thank you for your support, everybody!

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:54.540
Thank you for all the meals!

00:22:54.540 --> 00:22:57.610
And thank you very much for 
all of your votes, everyone!

00:22:58.210 --> 00:23:00.780
Please keep watching <i>Toriko</i>!

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:03.650
Please keep watching!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:08.240
It reeks!

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:12.200
It seems to be spreading out... ugh! Where's it coming from?! Stinky! This stench...

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.510
It's the stinkiest ever!

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:17.260
Toriko Faints in Agony?! Capture the World's Stinkiest Ingredient!

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:19.420
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
